<title>USA: Senetek skin treatment granted patent.</title>
<headline>Senetek skin treatment granted patent.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senetek PLC said Friday it has been granted U.S. patent protection for its VivaKin skin treatment.</p>
<p>Senetek said the treatment has been shown in scientific data to be effective and safe in treating aging skin.</p>
<p>The company also said that clinical studies now are in progress to establish farther the value of VivaKin in delaying or preventing unwanted changes in the appearance and texture of aging skin.</p>
<p>Senetek develops technologies and solutions for aging-related health problems.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
